def getRemainder(num, divisor): 

    # Handle divisor equals to 0 case 
    if (divisor == 0): 
        return False

    # Handle negative values 
    if (divisor < 0): 
        divisor = -divisor 
    if (num < 0):  
        num = -num 

    # Find the largest product of 'divisor' 
    # that is smaller than or equal to 'num' 
    i = 1
    product = 0
    while (product <= num): 
            product = divisor * i 
            i += 1
    # return remainder 
    return num - (product - divisor)
